{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2023-05-04 13:45:00', 'title': 'OCCIDENTAL ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON, MAY 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- OCCIDENTAL (NYSE: OXY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.18 PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON JULY 14, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 9, 2023.'}